This week I try to atone for my sins.
Proper Properties I&rsquo;ve got to get better at this socializing or social media or self-presentation and promotion, right? Last weekend I transcribed my thoughts into a YouTube slideshow &hellip;
 LINK &gt;
 &hellip; and I missed an issue that meant I needed to replace all of it. Quite embarrassing.
The Issue I&rsquo;m binding and &ldquo;instrumenting&rdquo; C++/17 classes via Template Meta Programming.

